From 99d46281fadce8b8b2db3d1fd965d0b9e7121735 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 08:12:32 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 02/12] Prepare the package layout: deprecation helper,
 _validation, explicit exports

equicdft/_deprecation.py carries EquicdftDeprecationWarning and the
warn_moved_module hook every compatibility shim of the coming module moves
will use. _argument_checks.py is renamed _validation.py (private module, no
shim). Every public module declares __all__ so the shims can re-export
exactly the names each old path offered, and __init__ exports __version__.
Test modules import their siblings as tests.<module>, so the suite runs
both as `discover -s tests` and as `discover -s tests -t .`.

