From 56909f5af6c218950e5592bcf8eb7b02da90646f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 08:18:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 03/12] Move grid geometry into equicdft.geometry

geometry/stencil.py (from stencil.py), geometry/grid.py (validators and
index arithmetic from _grid.py) and geometry/convolution.py (gather, dense
stencil and FFT convolutions from _grid.py). equicdft.stencil stays as a
deprecated shim re-exporting the same names with an
EquicdftDeprecationWarning; the private _grid path has no shim. Whole-object
pickles that recorded the old paths keep loading through
legacy._MODULE_ALIASES. Golden outputs unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CKJKJnMQ5g5crBBPsN5iZn
