Subject: [PATCH 07/12] Move training code into equicdft.training

training/loss.py (LossTerm, TensorLoss, Loss), training/metrics.py
(MetricCollection, Metrics), training/trainer.py (Trainer, TrainingStream),
training/io.py (history/log writers, from _trainer_io.py) and
training/noise.py (from _density_noise.py). atomic_torch_save, shared by
model files and checkpoints, lives in the private equicdft._io so
serialization does not depend on the training package. equicdft.loss,
equicdft.metrics and equicdft.trainer stay as deprecated shims, the first
two also re-exporting the Fourier classes that moved to equicdft.response;
legacy gains the module and class aliases. Golden outputs unchanged.

